    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/sg-2xu/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=609839730627969730&sectionId=609839730678301378)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdUa90LWo8_text","label":"ggdUa90LWo8_text","default":"FAQ"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_0","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_0","default":"<p>What are compression tights?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_1","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_1","default":"<p>HOW DO I KNOW WHICH COMPRESSION IS RIGHT FOR ME?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_2","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_2","default":"<p>What do compression tights do?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_3","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_3","default":"<p>Why wear compression tights?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_4","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_4","default":"<p>What is the difference between compression tights  and leggings?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_5","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_5","default":"<p>Do compression tights actually work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_6","label":"gg4CIF5bwJZ_childItem_6","default":"<p>Are compression tights only for elite athletes?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSdYaQmuy7_text","label":"ggSdYaQmuy7_text","default":"<p>Compression tights are performance garments designed to support the body during training, recovery and everyday movement. Available in a range of fits, silhouettes and colours, they’re built to help you feel and look your best—whatever the activity. They can be worn during workouts, as a base layer, or post-exercise to support recovery.<br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkA_LWiPiC_text","label":"ggkA_LWiPiC_text","default":"<p>Compression&nbsp;isn’t one-size-fits-all.​ The right piece depends on:​</p><ul><li>When you’re wearing it​</li><li>How you’re moving​</li><li>What your body needs next​&nbsp;</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggav95VBuPy_text","label":"ggav95VBuPy_text","default":"<p>Compression tights apply targeted pressure to support blood flow, keep muscles warm and reduce fatigue and strain during and after exercise.<br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRMSlwGKcv_text","label":"ggRMSlwGKcv_text","default":"<p>Compression tights help support performance and recovery by:</p><ul><li>Supporting circulation</li><li>Reducing muscle fatigue</li><li>Keeping muscles warm</li><li>Aiding post-workout recovery</li></ul><p>They’re suitable for training, running, sport, leisure and travel.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxO-JRPaKV_text","label":"ggxO-JRPaKV_text","default":"<p>Leggings are designed mainly for comfort and style. Compression tights are engineered to actively support muscles, circulation and recovery through targeted compression.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOdOZi9kCv_text","label":"ggOdOZi9kCv_text","default":"<p>Yes. When properly designed and fitted, compression tights help support circulation, reduce muscle soreness and assist recovery—helping you move and recover more efficiently.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZhSQDnycq_text","label":"ggZhSQDnycq_text","default":"<p>No. Compression tights are designed for all activity levels, with different compression levels available for training, leisure, recovery and travel.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
